    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i guess. but some people say that teaching kids \"identity is personal truth\" instead of focusing on biological sex is actually harmful or confusing for their development. do you think those people are just being old fashioned, or is there a valid concern there that i should be considering instead of just focusing on feelings?",
